When a command's key may fire:
  `builder` — focus is anywhere inside the builder;
  `selection` — inside the builder, in edit mode, with an item selected;
  `canvas` — focus is inside the canvas, in edit mode.
Never while typing in a text field (the keyboard kit's `inputs: "ignore"`).

